---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout'
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <main class="space-y-10">
    <section class="flex flex-wrap md:flex-nowrap items-center">
      <section class="space-y-5">
        <span class="font-semibold">Welcome to</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Easy Personal Finance</h1>
        <article class="md:w-8/12 text-slate-500 space-y-2">
          <p>
            Easy Personal Finance is a go-to blog for anyone who wants to handle money better without complicated jargon, confusing formulas, or risky financial tricks.
          </p>
          <p>
            We focus on beginner-friendly personal finance content, covering simple budgeting, daily money-saving tips, safe low-risk investing, debt management, credit score building, and practical side income ideas.
          </p>
          <p>No fancy financial degree required. All articles are written in plain, easy-to-understand English, helping ordinary people take control of their personal finances, build stable savings, avoid common financial mistakes, and grow wealth step by step.</p>
        </article>

        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <button
            class="bg-grayDeep text-white ring-2 font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-xl"
          >
            <a href="/"> Explore Posts </a>
          </button>
          <button
            class="ring-2 ring-grayDeep font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-xl"
          >
            <a href="/tags"> Browse by Tag </a>
          </button>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>

    <hr />

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">What We Cover</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-500">
        <li><strong>Budgeting Basics</strong> — Simple, practical budgeting methods for everyday life</li>
        <li><strong>Money-Saving Tips</strong> — Daily habits and strategies to keep more money in your pocket</li>
        <li><strong>Safe Investing</strong> — Low-risk investment options for beginners</li>
        <li><strong>Debt Management</strong> — Proven strategies to pay off debt faster</li>
        <li><strong>Credit Score Building</strong> — How to build and maintain a strong credit score</li>
        <li><strong>Side Income Ideas</strong> — Practical ways to earn extra money</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
